# In a Commander game no card is brought in from outside the game except by rules, special actions and effects that
# specifically bring cards into Commander games (CR 903.11): The Holodeck's "play a permanent card you own from outside
# the game" reaches neither Bot1's companion Kaheera nor its Forest, though both are outside the game and the mana is
# there. The companion's special action (CR 702.139c) still puts Kaheera into Bot1's hand for {3}.

